+ */
+
+/**
+ * Broadcast streaming viewer (audience side).
+ *
+ * Lets a user OUTSIDE any session join an active broadcast and receive
+ * live media from the broadcaster. Joins do NOT require an active
+ * Video SDK session.
+ *
+ * Status updates arrive via EventType.onStreamingJoinStatusChanged.
+ *
+ * Note: raw video / audio subscription (subscribeVideo / subscribeAudio
+ * on the native helper) is NOT exposed in this wrapper version.
